Bharata reports pleasant night to sage --- Bharata asks leave and Citrakūṭa road --- Bharadvāja describes Mandākinī beside Citrakūṭa --- Grieving mothers clasp sage feet --- Bharata names Kausalyā mother of Rāma --- Bharata names Sumitrā mother of Lakṣmaṇa Śatrughna pair --- Bharata denounces Kaikēyī as calamity root --- Bharadvāja absolves Kaikēyī foretelling good --- Bharata orders yoked army southward
